This repository is a private fork of shuohao-skills. The following changes were made
to the original work:

  - added skills/comfy-production (new files, Apache-2.0)
  - scripts/report-selftest.mjs: syntax assertion uses new vm.Script instead of new Function
  - added references/toonflow-*.md to skills/novel-outline, skills/novel-characters,
    skills/novel-art, skills/novel-script and skills/novel-storyboard: creative
    methodology learned from Toonflow-app (MIT License), internalized and
    rewritten in this repository's own terms; the source of each file is noted
    in its header
  - added references/s10-lighting.md to skills/novel-storyboard,
    references/s31-scene-craft.md to skills/novel-art,
    references/s33-dialogue-craft.md to skills/novel-script and
    references/s33-behavior.md to skills/novel-characters, plus related
    workflow text in skills/novel-outline: creative methodology learned from
    the Laotang skill packs (cinematic storyboard s10, scene skill 3.1 and
    storycraft s3.3, provided by the user), internalized and rewritten in
    this repository's own terms; the source of each file is noted in its
    header

The bundled sample story `skills/storycast/examples/渡口.txt` is an original
work written for this project and is covered by the same license.
